{"id":1174,"date":"2015-05-17T19:53:57","date_gmt":"2015-05-17T19:53:57","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=1174"},"modified":"2016-08-15T13:44:10","modified_gmt":"2016-08-15T13:44:10","slug":"venue","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/cambridge2015\/venue\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue"},"content":{"rendered":"<h4><a href=\"http:\/\/clareconferencing.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clare College Conferencing<\/a>, Cambridge University, 7-9th December.<\/h4>\n<p><strong>Note on walking to Clare College Conferencing<\/strong>: If you are walking to Clare College Conferencing please look at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.co.uk\/maps\/dir\/52.2055428,0.1179776\/52.2051046,0.1106493\/@52.2050514,0.1123826,17z\/data=!4m2!4m1!3e2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this link to Google Maps showing a shortcut route<\/a>\u00a0from the city centre. You can walk through the grounds of the Old Clare College, across the bridge and to the Conferencing part on the other side of the river. The street you should take &#8216;Senate House Passage&#8217;\u00a0is fairly small so look carefully for it &#8211; it is just to the right of Kings College <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.co.uk\/maps\/dir\/52.2055428,0.1179776\/52.2051046,0.1106493\/@52.2056348,0.1179634,3a,90y,282.27h,90t\/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1s8I5sF1xhYFc0C50-VrISqQ!2e0!6s%2F%2Fgeo1.ggpht.com%2Fcbk%3Fpanoid%3D8I5sF1xhYFc0C50-VrISqQ%26output%3Dthumbnail%26cb_client%3Dmaps_sv.tactile.gps%26thumb%3D2%26w%3D203%26h%3D100%26yaw%3D173.77284%26pitch%3D0!7i13312!8i6656!4m2!4m1!3e2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">as you can see on the map<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h6><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/800px-20130808_Castle_End_from_Kings_Bridge.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1177\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/800px-20130808_Castle_End_from_Kings_Bridge-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"Clare_College_from_Kings_Bridge\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/800px-20130808_Castle_End_from_Kings_Bridge-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/800px-20130808_Castle_End_from_Kings_Bridge.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/h6>\n<p>The tutorial day will be held on 7th December followed by the main conference on 8-9th December. Both will take place at Clare College Conferencing, Cambridge.\u00a0Clare College, founded 1326, is the second oldest College in the University. It sits in picturesque grounds on the banks of the river Cam (pictured above).<\/p>\n<p>Address:<br \/>\nMemorial Court<br \/>\nQueens Road<br \/>\nCambridge<br \/>\nCB3 9AJ<\/p>\n<p>Link to <a href=\"http:\/\/map.cam.ac.uk\/Clare+College?loc=2#52.205103,0.110077,17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">university map<\/a><br \/>\nLink to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.co.uk\/maps\/place\/Memorial+Court,+Queen&#039;s+Rd,+Cambridge,+Cambridgeshire+CB3+9AJ\/@52.2049478,0.1103579,17z\/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x47d870ba662df951:0x2fff2ce7d1b8bb21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clare College on Google Maps<\/a><\/p>\n<h3>SWAT4LS Hackathon<\/h3>\n<h4><a href=\"http:\/\/www.ebi.ac.uk\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">European Bioinformatics Institute<\/a>, Cambridge, 10th December.<\/h4>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_exterior_small.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-1197\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_exterior_small-300x199.jpg\" alt=\"EBI South Building\" width=\"317\" height=\"210\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_exterior_small-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_exterior_small-1024x681.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 317px) 100vw, 317px\" \/><\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_interior.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-1200\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_interior-254x300.jpg\" alt=\"EBI_south_interior\" width=\"188\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_interior-254x300.jpg 254w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/EBI_south_interior-867x1024.jpg 867w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 188px) 100vw, 188px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>The Hackathon event will take place on 10th December at the European Bioinformatics Institute (EMBL-EBI, pictured above). EBI is on <a href=\"http:\/\/www.wellcome.ac.uk\/Funding\/Biomedical-science\/Funded-projects\/Major-initiatives\/Wellcome-Trust-Sanger-Institute\/Wellcome-Trust-Genome-Campus\/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the\u00a0Genome Campus<\/a> in the grounds of Hinxton Hall.<\/p>\n<p>Address:<br \/>\nEuropean Bioinformatics Institute (EMBL-EBI)<br \/>\nGenome Campus<br \/>\nHinxton<br \/>\nCambridge<br \/>\nCB10 1SD<\/p>\n<p>Link to <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ebi.ac.uk\/about\/travel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">campus map and travel information<\/a><br \/>\nLink to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.co.uk\/maps\/place\/The+European+Bioinformatics+Institute\/@52.080033,0.186338,15z\/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x6581e9087d350702?sa=X&amp;ei=6vtYVZGiD8PxUp2agaAD&amp;ved=0CJEBEPwSMBM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EBI\u00a0on Google Maps<\/a><\/p>\n<p>External Clare College image:\u00a0<a title=\"User:Heuschrecke\" href=\"http:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/User:Heuschrecke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dmitry Tonkonog<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Clare College Conferencing, Cambridge University, 7-9th December. Note on walking to Clare College Conferencing: If you are